{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/18/3295836/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日は、チャリティーイベントに\nお越しくださった皆さん、\n来れずとも、応援してくださった皆さん、\n有難う御座いました  ！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"悪天候の中、寒い中、\n待たせちゃったりもしてごめんなさいっ(>_<)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/18/3295836/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それでも、笑顔で応援してくれて\n本当に嬉しかったし、\n幸せな時間を、有難う御座いました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/18/3295836/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/18/3295836/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もう、すごく楽しかったです！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"募金にもご協力していただき、\n有難う御座いました(>_<)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂メンバーと、乃木坂ファミリーの\n一体感を感じたイベントだったし、\nこのみんなの思いが、力となって\nこうして形となり、東北の方々に\nお届けすることができる思うと、\nなんだか嬉しかったです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなで助け合って一つのもの作り上げて\nまた一つ成長できたステージでした。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんなステージの裏側"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/18/3295836/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/18/3295836/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなみ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/18/3295836/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/18/3295836/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"魔法の鏡を持ってるお姫さまみたい(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"我らがキャプテン"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/18/3295836/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/18/3295836/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/18/3295836/0009.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして今日も朝早くから\nお仕事です(  *^o^*  )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"日曜日の朝は、メイク時間にテレビで\nヒーロータイムを見て、メンバーの前で\n一人騒ぐのが、いつものことです。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それでは、\n今日も１日頑張りましょう  ＊＊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/18/3295836/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/18/3295836/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/18/3295836/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"sayunyanヽ(｡･ω･｡)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/18/3295836/0012.gif","alt":""}],"source":"archive"}